  "item.description.unshattered.bat_the_fish": "Where is my cape!",
  "item.description.unshattered.century_the_fish": "The term 'century' was actually named after him, or so he says.",
  "item.description.unshattered.chill_the_fish": "This fish was found frozen solid in the lake of the island during the Holiday months.",
  "item.description.unshattered.clunk_the_fish": "Cluck cluck bkaawwk. Puk Puk Pukaaak!",
  "item.description.unshattered.diamond_the_fish": "Shines bright like a fish.",
  "item.description.unshattered.dust_the_fish": "Pretty sure they forgot about me...",
  "item.description.unshattered.egg_the_fish": "This delicate, painted fish was found in the depths of the island during the Easter season.",
  "item.description.unshattered.eon_the_fish": "Back in my day, we swam upstream for hours to get to school, and we didn't complain!",
  "item.description.unshattered.flake_the_fish": "I'm a special snowflake.",
  "item.description.unshattered.experiment_the_fish": "Fish me once, shame on you. Fish me twice, shame on me.",
  "item.description.unshattered.fossil_the_fish": "Older than time itself yet never changing, for he was born perfect.",
  "item.description.unshattered.gabagool_the_fish": "If the salad is on top, I send it back.",
  "item.description.unshattered.gift_the_fish": "I'm empty inside.",
  "item.description.unshattered.herring_the_fish": "Sometimes patience is the key to victory. Sometimes it leads to very little and it seems like it's not worth it. And you wonder why you waited so long for something so disappointing.",
  "item.description.unshattered.nope_the_fish": "Why did we follow Shrimp...",
  "item.description.unshattered.oops_the_fish": "Discovered in the depths of the island during the summer months.",
  "item.description.unshattered.party_the_fish": "Big fan of parties, yet it's hard to enjoy them without friends.",
  "item.description.unshattered.rock_the_fish": "Don't take me for granite.",
  "item.description.unshattered.shrimp_the_fish": "I achieved nothing.",
  "item.description.unshattered.skeleton_the_fish": "Once a beautiful bass, but his loud mouth got the better of him.",
  "item.description.unshattered.spook_the_fish": "This fish lurks in the darkness below the island during the Halloween season.",
  "item.description.unshattered.stew_the_fish": "The stew was expired.",
  "item.description.unshattered.swamp_the_fish": "I once tried a clear pond. too shiny. Never again.",
  "item.description.unshattered.zoop_the_fish": "Keep me in here please.",
  "item.description.unshattered.fig_log": "Each ring tells tales of sun-kissed days. Hold it close, and you might hear its stories.",
  "item.description.unshattered.bedrock": "[colour=0xFFFF5555]I guess you have this now.[/colour]",
  "item.description.unshattered.cake_soul": "What does it all mean???",
  "item.description.unshattered.rusty_cleaver": "Blunt yet lacking edge.",
  "item.description.unshattered.golden_cleaver": "Only superficially sharp, I wonder who made it?",
  "item.description.unshattered.super_cleaver": "Made for serious slicing and dicing.",
  "item.description.unshattered.hyper_cleaver": "Has aged like fine cleavers.",
  "item.description.unshattered.giant_cleaver": "Impractical for most adventurers.",
  "item.description.unshattered.mercenary_axe": "A well loved axe.",
